Poor, Lonely, Whitey

02:32.000 --> 02:34.460
Telepathy Club

02:32.000 --> 02:34.460
Body Improvement Club

02:32.000 --> 02:34.460
Thirty-one...

02:34.740 --> 02:36.990
Thirty-two...

02:37.280 --> 02:39.670
Thirty-three...

02:40.430 --> 02:42.850
Thirty-four...

02:44.390 --> 02:47.050
Thirty-five...

02:48.850 --> 02:50.870
You did it! That's a new record!

02:50.870 --> 02:53.810
You've gotten stronger, Kageyama!

02:53.810 --> 02:55.900
Your muscles are evolving!

02:53.810 --> 02:58.280
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

02:55.900 --> 02:58.280
All your efforts are finally paying off!

02:58.280 --> 03:02.030
Body improvement!!

02:58.280 --> 03:02.030
1: Squats 30x5
2: Planks 1 minx5
3: Side Planks 10
4: Leg Up Lifts 10x3
5: Leg Raise 10x5

02:58.880 --> 03:02.030
I thought his workouts were a waste of time,

03:03.090 --> 03:08.370
but the way he's improving step by step
will make him more confident as well.

03:08.980 --> 03:11.920
He even looks bolder.

03:11.920 --> 03:20.130
Potato
Demons

03:12.280 --> 03:14.790
Mob-kun's having fun,
being tossed in the air.

03:14.790 --> 03:16.320
Oh, I know!

03:16.320 --> 03:18.670
Why don't you toss him, too?

03:18.670 --> 03:20.130
It's his birthday today.

03:20.130 --> 03:21.790
Huh? No, that's okay.

03:21.790 --> 03:24.480
Is it your birthday, Kijibayashi?

03:24.480 --> 03:26.100
Y-Yeah...

03:26.100 --> 03:33.770
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

03:26.640 --> 03:29.450
What a joyous day! Let us celebrate!

03:29.450 --> 03:31.900
Oh, hey, President.
It was my birthday last week, too.

03:31.900 --> 03:33.770
What? It was?!

03:33.770 --> 03:36.620
Then why don't we throw a birthday party?

03:36.620 --> 03:38.670
How about we all go to a family restaurant?

03:38.670 --> 03:41.240
What a nice idea, Saruta!

03:41.240 --> 03:43.570
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

03:43.570 --> 03:45.070
What's this?

03:45.360 --> 03:48.530
It's extremely rare rock salt obtained
from the Uyuni Salt Flats,

03:48.530 --> 03:50.250
and it's excellent for exorcisms!

03:50.920 --> 03:52.260
Excuse me for a moment.

03:52.850 --> 03:55.040
Hello, this is the Spirits and
Such Consultation Office.

03:55.260 --> 03:57.840
What? Frozen tofu spirits?

03:57.840 --> 03:59.480
Of course, I've heard of them!

03:59.480 --> 04:00.760
Leave it to me.

04:01.080 --> 04:04.540
I'm getting one job after another lately...

04:04.890 --> 04:07.850
Guspo
Restaurant

04:04.890 --> 04:10.310
Happy birthday, happy birthday,
Kijibayashi and Kumakawa!

04:10.660 --> 04:15.860
Happy birthday, happy birthday,
happy birthday to you!

04:15.860 --> 04:19.360
We got the drink bar,
so let's drink until we've had our fill!

04:21.820 --> 04:26.640
I never thought you'd stick with the Body
Improvement Club for so long, Mob-kun.

04:26.640 --> 04:29.380
I thought he'd run away immediately.

04:29.380 --> 04:32.030
Kageyama's pretty persistent.

04:32.030 --> 04:34.370
Do you have some huge goal
you want to accomplish?

04:34.590 --> 04:36.420
If you keep at it for another six months,

04:36.420 --> 04:39.520
I think you'll reach the level of an
average second-year middle schooler.

04:39.520 --> 04:40.340
Nah.

04:40.800 --> 04:44.930
I'm sure Kageyama has his sights set
on a much loftier goal.

04:45.330 --> 04:49.010
If we let our guards down,
he might surpass us before we know it!

04:49.420 --> 04:52.040
All he wants is for the girl he likes
to look his way, really.

04:52.730 --> 04:55.730
That was it at first, but now...

04:56.000 --> 04:58.800
By the way, Mob-kun,
I hope you haven't forgotten.

04:58.800 --> 05:01.190
You're supposed to help me
find other telepaths.

05:01.190 --> 05:03.380
Oh. You're still looking for them?

05:03.380 --> 05:06.910
Of course I am! What do you think
the point of the Telepathy Club is?!

05:07.210 --> 05:11.380
More importantly, why don't
we all go to karaoke?

05:08.470 --> 05:09.580
"More importantly"?!

05:11.380 --> 05:13.080
Huh? Karaoke?

05:13.080 --> 05:15.040
What? You've never gone before?

05:15.040 --> 05:18.250
Let's go, then. A chance like this
won't come along very often.

05:18.710 --> 05:21.580
Well, if you insist...

05:22.180 --> 05:23.840
What should I sing?

05:23.840 --> 05:26.030
Feeling shy, Mob?

05:26.030 --> 05:28.370
You'll be fine once you start singing.

05:28.370 --> 05:32.430
No, I was just thinking it's been a while
since I've done something like this.

05:32.760 --> 05:34.810
Just hanging out with people.

05:35.800 --> 05:37.600
I-It's so much fun...

05:39.690 --> 05:41.110
Incoming call

05:39.690 --> 05:41.110
Master Reigen

05:39.690 --> 05:41.110
Menu

05:43.140 --> 05:44.100
Hello?

05:44.100 --> 05:45.160
Oh hey, Mob.

05:45.160 --> 05:47.330
There's an evil spirit
giving me some trouble.

05:47.330 --> 05:50.700
I mean, I could totally deal with it myself,
but there's been so much work lately.

05:50.700 --> 05:52.820
I'd rather not use too much of my power...

05:53.400 --> 05:54.330
Mob?

05:54.970 --> 05:58.150
Master, could you handle
things on your own today?

05:58.550 --> 05:59.170
Huh?

05:59.580 --> 06:04.980
I-I've asked you many times before
not to summon me on such short notice.

06:06.130 --> 06:08.700
What are you talking about?
I bet you're free, anyway.

06:08.700 --> 06:10.290
Is there a reason you can't show up?

06:11.410 --> 06:14.140
There's a client who really
needs your help here.

06:14.330 --> 06:17.510
I'll be waiting for you,
so try not to take too long.

06:22.590 --> 06:24.380
What's the matter, Kageyama?

06:24.380 --> 06:26.780
Must be that shady-ass master of yours again.

06:27.330 --> 06:30.990
A sudden job came in, so I won't
be able to go to karaoke.

06:31.390 --> 06:34.120
I'm really sorry for missing out
on your birthdays.

06:34.350 --> 06:37.040
Oh, don't worry about us.

06:37.040 --> 06:39.210
Yeah, you've done plenty.

06:39.390 --> 06:42.220
Some things take priority over others.

06:42.220 --> 06:43.920
It's okay. We understand.

06:50.390 --> 06:54.810
The ghost of a man who hit his head
on a block of frozen tofu and died?

06:54.970 --> 06:56.710
That rumor was true?

06:57.540 --> 07:02.560
How about I make you think of me
every time you see a block of tofu?!

07:04.120 --> 07:05.980
Please, hurry up and exorcise him!

07:06.240 --> 07:07.830
Have no fear.

07:07.830 --> 07:10.540
I have my disciple heading over immediately.

07:16.800 --> 07:18.620
You're a lifesaver, Mob.

07:29.440 --> 07:30.340
What's wrong?

07:30.880 --> 07:34.390
Even I have school and a private life.

07:34.680 --> 07:36.960
So please, stop summoning me
out of the blue.

07:36.960 --> 07:40.930
A private life? Just working out
in that club of yours, right?

07:41.860 --> 07:45.060
Or did you fall for another
person jokingly asking you out?

07:45.230 --> 07:47.360
You get taken advantage of so easily.

07:47.360 --> 07:50.490
Grow up, for crying out loud.

07:52.800 --> 07:54.950
I don't know what you were doing
with your schoolmates,

07:55.320 --> 07:57.610
but do they really understand you?

07:58.350 --> 08:00.800
Come on, we're saving lives here!

08:01.070 --> 08:04.420
You're making a difference in
the world by helping me out!

08:04.610 --> 08:07.080
Not to mention, I'm your master!

08:07.080 --> 08:12.380
I'm one of the biggest reasons
you're able to control your powers!

08:12.680 --> 08:14.000
Listen up...

08:14.000 --> 08:16.420
Choose your social circle wisely, Mob!

08:16.420 --> 08:20.100
If they're going to get in the way of
your exorcism job, get rid of them!

08:20.510 --> 08:24.120
They don't actually care about you.

08:24.120 --> 08:26.980
They're just having fun
mocking someone as wimpy as you.

08:26.980 --> 08:27.840
That's not true!

08:28.980 --> 08:32.240
I-I might've said too much there...

08:33.200 --> 08:35.200
They aren't mocking me.

08:35.440 --> 08:36.920
R-Right...

08:38.110 --> 08:42.540
I'm starting to understand that not
everything you say is true, Master.

08:42.540 --> 08:44.460
Dug his own grave

08:42.700 --> 08:44.460
Shit. I messed up...

08:44.680 --> 08:48.080
C-Come on now, Mob! You must be tired!

08:48.080 --> 08:49.920
Let's get some ramen on the way back.

08:50.280 --> 08:55.010
I'm not being mocked, nor am
I easily taken advantage of.

08:59.930 --> 09:01.970
Reception

08:59.930 --> 09:01.970
The New Star of
the 21st Century
Reigen Arataka's
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

09:00.390 --> 09:01.970
Damn it, Mob...

09:02.140 --> 09:04.880
I'd promised this client in advance...

09:04.880 --> 09:07.110
He finally decided not to show up.

09:07.570 --> 09:11.240
I guess I really did say too much yesterday.

09:12.150 --> 09:13.300
But then again...

09:13.300 --> 09:17.910
He shouldn't have anyone he can talk
to about his problems other than me.

09:18.620 --> 09:22.040
If he cuts ties with me,
he's going to end up alone again.

09:22.480 --> 09:26.130
There's nothing to worry about.
He'll be back here. I know it.

09:27.790 --> 09:29.350
Huh? Nii-san?

09:29.640 --> 09:31.380
You're home early today.

09:31.860 --> 09:33.710
Welcome home, Ritsu.

09:33.710 --> 09:36.800
I've decided not to go to
Master's place for a while.

09:37.520 --> 09:40.440
That's fine and all,
but what brought this on?

09:40.440 --> 09:43.520
They had a fight. He cut ties with him.

09:43.840 --> 09:47.870
That's not it. But I gave it a lot of
thought and made my decision.

09:48.240 --> 09:52.670
I've been blindly following what
Master Reigen says way too often.

09:53.110 --> 09:57.930
I felt like things went better that way,
so it was easier for me.

09:58.470 --> 09:59.410
But...

09:59.680 --> 10:02.790
Grow up, for crying out loud.

10:03.870 --> 10:06.510
I realized that I can't just
keep relying on him,

10:06.510 --> 10:10.080
so I thought I'd reconsider
what I want to do a bit more.

10:12.580 --> 10:14.300
Wanna play some video games for once?

10:15.500 --> 10:17.820
Too bad, Reigen.

10:17.820 --> 10:20.040
It's your own fault for messing up.

10:21.670 --> 10:24.140
I feel like I've sweat off
whatever was lurking over me.

10:24.380 --> 10:27.320
Coral steam yoga is the best.

10:27.320 --> 10:29.350
Glad to hear it.

10:29.850 --> 10:32.220
Thank goodness it wasn't a real spirit.

10:32.860 --> 10:34.820
4 Years Ago

10:33.940 --> 10:35.860
Why am I so surprised, though?

