10:40.200 --> 10:42.660
Why would I be in any trouble
if Mob decides to not show up?

10:43.110 --> 10:48.410
I just need to continue focusing
on the jobs I can do by myself.

10:49.230 --> 10:51.790
I can let the real psychics
deal with actual spirits.

10:52.150 --> 10:55.300
Yeah! Now I can reduce labor costs,

10:55.300 --> 10:57.850
and I won't have to hear
about his teenage dilemmas.

10:58.300 --> 11:00.340
I only have so much time in a day.

11:00.670 --> 11:04.210
I should use it to study
and learn more about the world.

11:04.210 --> 11:07.310
Hey, I'm becoming rather
optimistic about this.

11:07.830 --> 11:11.090
Sorry, Mob. You probably
weren't expecting this,

11:11.090 --> 11:13.520
but I'm not sad about this at all.

11:13.520 --> 11:19.490
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

11:13.770 --> 11:16.470
I'm sure you're probably feeling
pretty lonely right about now.

11:19.490 --> 11:26.490
Mob Psycho

11:29.040 --> 11:31.210
Salt

11:38.240 --> 11:42.060
I'm sure Mob's really regretting this by now.

11:42.580 --> 11:44.990
Maybe he feels awkward about talking to me.

11:45.980 --> 11:50.180
I'm mature enough to understand,
so it's not like I'd even care.

11:55.730 --> 11:57.480
Super popular!!

12:02.370 --> 12:05.490
Impossible! Mob looks like
he's actually having fun!

12:05.490 --> 12:07.770
He actually had friends?!

12:07.770 --> 12:09.330
What the hell are you hiding for, dumbass?

12:09.330 --> 12:19.760
Yosokaze!

12:09.860 --> 12:10.970
Dimple!

12:10.970 --> 12:13.610
I-I'm not hiding at all!

12:13.610 --> 12:15.620
You don't need to worry about Mob anymore.

12:15.620 --> 12:16.930
He's having fun.

12:16.930 --> 12:19.760
Well, too bad I'm not
actually worried at all!

12:20.010 --> 12:21.450
Good to hear.

12:21.450 --> 12:25.100
Shigeo doesn't seem to be
concerned about you at all.

12:25.100 --> 12:26.470
It's rather peaceful.

12:26.750 --> 12:28.720
What?!

12:29.830 --> 12:32.060
Are you okay with this, Dimple?

12:32.060 --> 12:33.080
What do you mean?

12:33.080 --> 12:37.310
The more he stays away from me,
the less he'll use his powers.

12:37.600 --> 12:43.240
Do you want to be an ordinary
middle schooler's pet forever?

12:43.630 --> 12:45.160
Guess that would be pretty peaceful.

12:45.160 --> 12:51.040
Pork roast

12:45.160 --> 12:51.040
Paella
comes with a salad

12:46.100 --> 12:51.040
I think you wanted to use Mob's powers
to do something, but sucks to be you.

12:51.260 --> 12:54.430
Now that Mob's decided to
lead such a mundane life,

12:54.430 --> 12:56.870
he's of no use to anybody!

12:56.870 --> 13:01.290
I hope you have fun following
around a normal middle schooler.

13:01.290 --> 13:05.050
I, on the other hand, will be
moving on to the next stage!

13:06.040 --> 13:09.320
Well, I'm glad to see
you're doing all right.

13:09.320 --> 13:12.470
If you can crack jokes like that,
I guess there's no need to worry.

13:13.160 --> 13:15.690
Who knows? We may never
see each other again.

13:35.250 --> 13:37.930
Guess I'll update the homepage.

13:38.920 --> 13:41.380
Karaoke

13:39.990 --> 13:42.260
Huh? Aren't we going home?

13:42.260 --> 13:45.590
Weren't we giving up looking
for telepaths today?

13:45.850 --> 13:48.470
You couldn't go the other day
because of work, right?

13:48.470 --> 13:50.050
We're here anyway, so let's go.

13:50.050 --> 13:58.190
Karaoke

13:50.250 --> 13:54.330
You'll be able to sense a telepath
if they're nearby, right?

13:54.330 --> 13:56.190
Then you can do it while you're singing, too.

13:56.190 --> 13:58.190
But wait! I'm not mentally prepared!

13:58.190 --> 14:01.070
Oh, come on. Get in there.

14:01.070 --> 14:05.780
Newbie Idol's Blog Gets Flamed

14:01.430 --> 14:04.130
A newbie idol's blog got flamed, huh?

14:06.250 --> 14:09.920
I guess I haven't checked
Friendbook in a while.

14:10.280 --> 14:13.630
In this day and age, you can connect
with the people you know at any time.

14:13.630 --> 14:15.750
Talk about convenient.

14:16.080 --> 14:18.440
Hey, I have a message!

14:18.440 --> 14:21.840
Sorry for not reading it sooner.
I've just been so busy.

