15:20.000 --> 15:21.270
Are you having fun?

15:20.000 --> 15:22.650
So all together now

15:22.260 --> 15:23.270
I think so?

15:22.650 --> 15:25.350
Melancholy!

15:25.890 --> 15:27.830
You have no rhythm, do you, Mob-kun?

15:27.830 --> 15:29.080
Yeah! Wahoo!

15:29.080 --> 15:29.880
Correct.

15:30.900 --> 15:34.370
Reunion

15:37.080 --> 15:38.830
Happy Trails

15:40.870 --> 15:43.150
Ooh, Arataka-chan!

15:43.150 --> 15:45.790
Welcome. It's been too long.

15:46.090 --> 15:48.970
Hey, it's Reigen-san! Reigen-sensei is here!

15:48.970 --> 15:52.630
Sensei! Come sit over here, Sensei!

15:52.910 --> 15:54.150
One lemon sour...

15:54.760 --> 15:56.100
Extra on the sour.

15:56.550 --> 15:58.610
Should you be drinking?

15:58.610 --> 15:59.560
Yeah.

16:00.250 --> 16:06.010
The regulars here are a bunch of people
who'd fall for pyramid schemes or fake cults.

16:06.640 --> 16:11.030
People like that who want someone
to vent their troubles to

16:11.030 --> 16:13.740
relieve their stress at this bar.

16:11.030 --> 16:13.740
Happy Trails

16:14.220 --> 16:17.450
It's basically a gold mine
for someone like me.

16:17.850 --> 16:20.250
It's a place where a bunch
of weak people gather.

16:20.250 --> 16:22.150
Hear me out, Reigen-san!

16:22.150 --> 16:25.050
The other day, this really
pretty girl talked to me.

16:25.050 --> 16:27.710
When I followed her, she led
me to some art exhibit...

16:28.110 --> 16:31.520
You were taken to an exhibit where a copy
of a famous painting was on display.

16:31.520 --> 16:33.180
It's a dating scheme.

16:33.700 --> 16:36.410
I'll hear them out and give them
some random words of advice.

16:36.410 --> 16:38.060
Apparently, that's enough
for them to respect me.

16:38.460 --> 16:42.480
Maybe they're... almost like friends to me.

16:49.270 --> 16:52.190
It's... my birthday today.

16:53.400 --> 16:54.540
Well, happy birthday.

16:54.540 --> 16:56.420
Happy birthday, Sensei.

16:56.420 --> 16:57.660
Happy birthday.

16:57.960 --> 16:59.020
Thanks.

16:59.930 --> 17:02.670
This is the perfect time to bring
this up since it's your birthday!

17:02.670 --> 17:07.250
I have this amazing pillow I got
from this extra special connection.

17:07.250 --> 17:10.630
It's memory foam, so you'll sleep like
a baby! It's worth 120,000 yen, but...

17:15.100 --> 17:17.920
Arataka-chan, this is your
first drink, isn't it?

17:17.920 --> 17:20.420
Your face is all red. Are you all right?

17:20.980 --> 17:22.310
Nope.

17:25.820 --> 17:27.690
Wh-What's wrong?

17:28.300 --> 17:30.400
Tab, please.

17:35.360 --> 17:37.560
Well, that backfired.

17:37.560 --> 17:40.080
I was thinking that I wanted
to talk to someone... anyone.

17:40.940 --> 17:44.360
I guess I don't have any friends.

17:45.600 --> 17:48.380
But I didn't even put any alcohol in it...

17:59.170 --> 18:01.180
This situation's not good...

18:01.180 --> 18:03.580
I'm going in a very bad direction.

18:03.580 --> 18:04.840
Me, of all people!

18:06.070 --> 18:07.270
Wait... Me?

18:08.680 --> 18:10.020
I mean what...

18:11.270 --> 18:11.820
What...

18:12.780 --> 18:13.670
What am I?

18:24.940 --> 18:26.750
I guess I'm just going to have to...

18:27.510 --> 18:29.120
become somebody.

18:38.710 --> 18:43.460
After ending up alone and getting over it,
Reigen made a huge change.

18:49.140 --> 18:52.310
I, Reigen Arataka, shall accept this job!

18:50.190 --> 18:52.310
New Reigen Arataka

18:52.310 --> 18:55.110
Spirits and Such
Consultation Office

18:52.800 --> 18:55.660
He started beautifying the city,

18:55.690 --> 18:57.990
live-streamed exorcisms online,

18:57.990 --> 18:59.490
Don't tell people personal information they don't
need to know        No payments upfront
Don't sign any contracts
Vases | Holy water | Salt
Cooling off...

18:58.240 --> 19:01.260
held free seminars and even
offered people life counseling,

19:01.260 --> 19:03.990
broadening his field of work.

19:01.410 --> 19:02.490
Noritama-san's Review

19:01.410 --> 19:02.490
Post a review

19:01.410 --> 19:02.490
"Spirits and Such Consultation Office" is wonderful.
The man in charge, Reigen Arataka-san, is a true psychic.
Because of him, my body feels much lighter, and I can feel my luck improving.
User ID: 2875934091

