19:02.740 --> 19:03.990
Post a review

19:02.740 --> 19:03.990
Reigen Arataka-san is one of the few real psychics.
He listened to me, gave me advice, and I finally met my match.
Thank you so much.
User ID: 3829573019

19:03.990 --> 19:08.040
However, he continued to execute his
usual exorcism jobs with vigor.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.240
Stray Cat of the Dawn's Review

19:04.240 --> 19:05.240
Post a review

19:04.240 --> 19:05.240
I'm so thankful that I just can't stop crying.
No one was willing to help me out, but Reigen...
I might just be falling in love...
User ID: 867840127

