All of our satisfied customers

19:08.350 --> 19:12.110
Among his most recent jobs,
there was a rumor that the Player Killer

19:11.580 --> 19:15.750
Fantasy Hell

19:12.110 --> 19:16.410
from the super-popular online game,
Fantasy Hell, was actually a ghost.

19:16.410 --> 19:20.220
It was a difficult job that many
other psychics declined to take.

19:20.220 --> 19:22.430
We asked Shinra Banshomaru
what he thought

19:22.330 --> 19:24.960
I've heard of it, but don't even bother.

19:24.960 --> 19:27.310
It's not something we can handle.

19:27.310 --> 19:30.570
Our spiritual power can't
do anything inside a game.

19:30.930 --> 19:31.810
Right?

19:32.000 --> 19:36.940
Meaning it was a target that even
Mob wouldn't be able to exorcise.

19:37.280 --> 19:41.460
However, Reigen used multiple accounts
and stayed up late many nights,

19:41.460 --> 19:44.590
repeatedly leveling up and
strengthening his weapons...

19:44.590 --> 19:47.600
He then baited the ghost
player and surrounded it,

19:47.600 --> 19:49.460
then beat the crap out of him.

19:49.880 --> 19:53.170
And then, finally,
he succeeded in the exorcism.

19:53.480 --> 19:56.750
Y-You're amazing!
You actually exorcised him!

19:56.750 --> 19:58.790
But how?

19:58.790 --> 20:01.220
Well, I am a psychic...

20:01.560 --> 20:04.680
Shit. I made too many in-game purchases,
and now I'm in the red...

20:05.120 --> 20:07.290
Because of this successful job,

20:07.290 --> 20:11.160
