22:08.800 --> 22:11.810
My disciples told me about
what happened that day!

22:11.810 --> 22:16.060
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike

22:11.910 --> 22:16.060
They told me how you had the nerve to
nail me with a jumping knee strike!

22:16.060 --> 22:18.850
I'm going to make you pay dearly!

22:18.850 --> 22:23.230
I'll make damn sure you
regret what you've done!

23:55.470 --> 23:57.670
The new star of the 21st
century, Reigen Arataka!

23:57.670 --> 23:58.870
